{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0x1ZHdpZyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv","type":"series","name":"Ludwig","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/6xpAG4tJKhRT6y2Uxw2nAJareoQ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9HQnJdzu92M81huqyT9jQQyaU6P.jpg","description":"John Taylor lives in quiet solitude, designing puzzles for a living, under the nom-de-plume of 'Ludwig'. When his identical twin, James, disappears off the face of the earth, John takes over his brother's identity in a quest to discover his whereabouts.\n\nRated TV-14 · Returning Series · First aired 25 Sept 2024 · United Kingdom · Language: English\nStudio: That Mitchell & Webb Company, Big Talk Studios, BBC · Network: BBC One\n\nNot complete. On your server: S1 6/6 | S2 not on server\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2024","genres":["Mystery","Crime","Drama","Comedy","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0x1ZHdpZyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2024-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Puzzle setter John ‘Ludwig’ Taylor’s life is upended when his identical twin, DCI James Taylor, disappears. John reluctantly assumes his identity in order to track him down.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/perMuyDoEMDpwFNC1ilctJoypHJ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0x1ZHdpZyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2024-10-02T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"On a mission to crack the code in his twin’s notebook, John returns to the police station. A frustrated Lucy takes matters into her own hands and plays detective herself.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ydLP8Nisju3Im2gPuxq81DPEtEY.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0x1ZHdpZyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2024-10-09T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A new case takes Ludwig on a walking tour of Cambridge, where he’s faced with an impossible question. Meanwhile, Lucy goes undercover and makes a grim discovery of her own.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rJHurIQstoSDrDzl168B56gTsf6.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0x1ZHdpZyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-10-16T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A body falls from the fourth storey of a construction site. Was it just a terrible accident, or a perfectly executed murder? When things don’t add up, John questions his abilities.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fD2mOgKjFkZ1NqWSwDZePiEpnOQ.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0x1ZHdpZyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-10-23T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"John and the gang go back to school to investigate the suspicious death of a headmaster. Lucy sneaks off on a covert mission, and a shocking revelation leaves John reeling.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/35eI1ucIKQs1obUCnlPo3mSHngw.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI0L0x1ZHdpZyUyMCUyODIwMjQlMjkv.1.6","title":"Episode 6","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-10-30T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A cryptic late night call from Holly sees Lucy lured into danger. Back at the station, all eyes are on John as the pressure ramps up. Will his cover finally be blown?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gXcX11AznO9E9GzIJdrwzbZm0JR.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"7.8","cast":["David Mitchell","Anna Maxwell Martin","Dipo Ola","Ben Ashenden","Rumi Sutton","Dorothy Atkinson","Dylan Hughes","Ralph Ineson"],"director":["Mark Brotherhood"],"released":"2024-09-25T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Mark Brotherhood","character":"Director"},{"name":"David Mitch